# CONFIG's Planner page: Joystick Setup's window, and what the joystick page draws over the whole
# window from it. Ported from GCSViews/ConfigurationView/ConfigPlanner.cs:553-556 and
# Joystick/JoystickSetup.cs; the page itself is tests/gui/config-joystick.gui's, on SETUP.
#
# The claim: the page in the Planner's window draws its boxes and forms as SETUP draws them - a
# button row's Settings opens the form for its function (JoystickSetup.cs:453-487), a Change Mode
# form for a button the files say nothing of (JoyButton's first function), over the window, and
# its close box closes it. The click crawl found the form opened and never drawn here (2026-10-15):
# only SETUP's body drew the page's boxes.
#
# Detect with no joystick: getPressedButton finds no device of the box's name and answers -1 at
# once, without a word (JoystickBase.cs:186-191), and the row shows -1 already; the status line says
# why, quietly - the owner's rule of 2026-10-14 for a press that does nothing visible.
#
# No joystick on this machine: the list is empty, and the C#'s Linux joystick then makes ten button
# rows (JoystickLinux.cs:293-312). No vehicle: the page needs none. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/config-planner-joystick.gui

screen config
window 1600x1200
budget 5
env XDG_DATA_HOME $WORK
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml

expect config.page ConfigPlanner
click planner-BUT_Joystick
expect config.planner.joystick true
expect config.joystick.host planner
expect config.joystick.devices 0
expect config.joystick.buttons 10
expect config.joystick.but0.function ChangeMode

# Settings: the form, drawn over the window - its close box is there to click.
click joystick-but0-settings
expect config.joystick.form Joy_ChangeMode
expect config.joystick.form.slot 0
click joystick-form-close
expect config.joystick.form none

# Detect: -1, as it was, and the status line says why.
expect config.joystick.but0.buttonno -1
click joystick-but0-detect
expect status.drawn no joystick
expect status-bar below tab-fly
expect config.joystick.but0.buttonno -1
expect config.joystick.message none

click planner-joystick-close
expect config.planner.joystick false
expect config.joystick.active false
